  - id: fables_and_genealogies_1tim
    displayName: Fables and Endless Genealogies
    flavorText: Paul charges Timothy to silence those who chase myths and genealogical
      disputes that stir up questions instead of godly edifying.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Warns against speculative teaching \u2014 myths, genealogical disputes,
      and misapplied use of the Mosaic law \u2014 that ministers questions rather
      than godly edifying."
