  - id: prayers_for_all_men_1tim
    displayName: Prayers, Supplications, and Intercessions
    flavorText: Paul instructs that prayers and thanksgiving be lifted for all men,
      even kings, since God wills all men to be saved through the one Mediator, Christ
      Jesus.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Instructs the church to pray broadly, including for kings and civil
      authority, grounding the instruction in God's universal will to save and Christ's
      role as the one mediator between God and men.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_1tim
    managerId: prayers_for_all_men_1tim
