  - id: doctrines_of_devils_1tim
    displayName: Doctrines of Devils in the Latter Times
    flavorText: Paul warns that in the latter times some will depart from the faith,
      forbidding marriage and foods that God created good to be received with thanksgiving.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns of a coming falling-away marked by false asceticism, countered
      by the teaching that everything God created is good and by a charge to exercise
      unto godliness.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_1tim
    managerId: doctrines_of_devils_1tim
