  - id: widow_indeed_1tim
    displayName: The Widow Indeed
    flavorText: Paul instructs the church to honor widows indeed, who trust in God
      and continue in prayer, while their own families bear the first duty of care.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Sets criteria for the church's care of widows and for enrolling certain
      widows into a recognized order of service, distinguishing genuine need from
      cases family should address.
