  - id: love_of_money_1tim
    displayName: The Love of Money
    flavorText: Paul warns that the love of money is a root of all evil that has
      pierced some through with many sorrows, while godliness with contentment is
      itself great gain.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Warns against false teachers who treat godliness as a means of profit,
